      "body": "A draft AITER PR, ROCm/aiter#6363, proposes the E385/top-7 A8W4 MoE rows used by DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash at TP4 with the fused shared expert. It is not ready: the rows at M 64, 256 and 512 require the stage-1 race fix in ROCm/aiter#6170, and the 16k serving result remains unexplained. In our serving tests the rows gave no TTFT gain at 8k, 60k and 128k prompts. No SGLang code change is needed: after the AITER rows are merged and included in an image, SGLang selects them through its existing lookup. This SGLang draft is a pointer only.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38032542992](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38032542992)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38032542840](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38032542840)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:heavy_minus_sign: **No AMD PR run found for this commit**.<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
